// SOUNDNESS QUEUE row static_mut_str_slice_write_admits (tier 2).
// NEIGHBOUR of bc_admits issue-69114-static-mut-ty, ROWED — reason 1 (the fact has
// no carrier there). The write to the `static mut` IS checked (2026-09-13d) and the
// declared `&str` is filled 'static, but the comparator reads no region on a borrowed
// slice: `let r: &'static str = s.as_str()` compiles too. Same fact as bc_admits
